---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Global Agricultural Search
meta_title: Global Agricultural Search | GoOrganicAfrica
meta_description: Search GoOrganicAfrica resources, agricultural news, opportunities, markets, machinery, training, events, eBooks and blog content in one place.
description: Search across GoOrganicAfrica's agricultural intelligence and knowledge directories.
permalink: /search/
language: en
---

<style>
.goa-search{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px 16px}
.goa-search h1{margin-bottom:8px}
.goa-search-intro{margin-bottom:18px}
.goa-search-box{width:100%;padding:14px 16px;border:1px solid #ccc;border-radius:10px;font-size:1rem;box-sizing:border-box}
.goa-search-controls{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 220px;gap:10px;margin:12px 0 18px}
.goa-search-results{display:grid;gap:12px}
.goa-search-card{border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:10px;padding:15px;background:#fff}
.goa-search-card h2{font-size:1.05rem;margin:0 0 6px}
.goa-search-card a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
.goa-search-card a:hover{text-decoration:underline}
.goa-search-meta{font-size:.85rem;opacity:.75;margin-bottom:7px}
.goa-search-summary{margin:0}
.goa-search-empty{padding:24px;border:1px dashed #bbb;border-radius:10px;text-align:center}
@media(max-width:650px){.goa-search-controls{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>

<div class="goa-search">
  <h1 data-i18n="search.title">Global Agricultural Search</h1>
  <p class="goa-search-intro" data-i18n="search.intro">Search across GoOrganicAfrica resources, news, opportunities, markets, machinery, suppliers, training, events, eBooks and blog.</p>

  <div class="goa-search-controls">
    <input id="goa-global-search" class="goa-search-box" type="search" placeholder="Search agriculture, maize, Nigeria, finance, machinery, training..." data-i18n-placeholder="search.placeholder" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Search GoOrganicAfrica" data-i18n-aria-label="search.ariaLabel">
    <select id="goa-search-type" class="goa-search-box" aria-label="Filter search results" data-i18n-aria-label="search.filterLabel">
      <option value="" data-i18n="search.allSections">All sections</option>
      <option value="Resource" data-i18n="search.resources">Resources</option>
      <option value="News" data-i18n="search.news">Agricultural News</option>
      <option value="Opportunity" data-i18n="search.opportunities">Opportunities</option>
      <option value="Market" data-i18n="search.markets">Markets</option>
      <option value="Service" data-i18n="search.services">Services & Machinery</option>
      <option value="eBook" data-i18n="search.ebooks">eBooks</option>
      <option value="Blog" data-i18n="search.blog">Blog</option>
    </select>
  </div>

  <p id="goa-search-count" aria-live="polite"></p>
  <div id="goa-search-connections" style="display:none;margin:16px 0 24px;">
    <div style="border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:18px;background:var(--paper);">
      <h2 style="margin-top:0;" data-i18n="search.connectedTitle">Connected Agricultural Intelligence</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:14px;" data-i18n="search.connectedIntro">Use the same topic or country across different GoOrganicAfrica sections to move from information to action.</p>
      <div id="goa-connection-cards" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(170px,1fr));gap:10px;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div id="goa-search-results" class="goa-search-results"></div>

  <noscript><p class="goa-search-empty" data-i18n="search.noScript">Please enable JavaScript to use Global Search.</p></noscript>

  <div id="goa-search-source" hidden>
    {% for country in agriculturalResourcesAll.countries %}
      {% for category in agriculturalResourcesAll.categories %}
        {% for r in country.records[category] %}
          {% if (r.status == "official" or r.status == "published" or r.status == "verified") and (not r.lifecycle or r.lifecycle == "current") and r.title %}
            <article data-type="Resource" data-country-code="{{ country.code }}" data-title="{{ r.title }}" data-summary="{{ r.description or r.summary or '' }}" data-keywords="{{ r.search_terms or '' }} {{ r.keywords or '' }} {{ r.tags or '' }} {{ r.slug or '' }}" data-meta="{{ country.name or country.country or country.code }} · {{ category }} · {{ r.source or '' }}" data-url="{{ r.url or r.source_url or '/agriculture-resources/' }}"></article>
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      {% endfor %}
    {% endfor %}
    {% for country in agriculturalNewsMerged.countries %}
      {% for r in country.articles %}
        {% if (r.status == "official" or r.status == "published" or r.status == "verified") and (not r.lifecycle or r.lifecycle == "current") and r.url %}
          <article data-type="News" data-title="{{ r.title }}" data-summary="{{ r.summary or '' }}" data-keywords="{{ r.search_terms or '' }} {{ r.keywords or '' }}" data-meta="{{ country.name or country.country or country.code }} · {{ r.category or '' }} · {{ r.source or '' }}" data-url="{{ r.url }}"></article>
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    {% endfor %}
    {% for r in agriculturalOpportunities.records %}
      {% if (r.status == "open" or r.status == "active") and (not r.lifecycle or r.lifecycle == "current") %}
        <article data-type="Opportunity" data-title="{{ r.title }}" data-summary="{{ r.summary or r.description or '' }}" data-keywords="{{ r.search_terms or '' }} {{ r.keywords or '' }} {{ r.tags or '' }}" data-meta="{{ r.country or r.country_code or '' }} · {{ r.type or r.category or '' }} · {{ r.provider or r.source or '' }}" data-url="{{ r.application_url or r.source_url or r.url or '/opportunities/' }}"></article>
      {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
    {% for r in agriculturalMarkets.records %}
      <article data-type="Market" data-title="{{ r.commodity or 'Market information' }}{% if r.market %} — {{ r.market }}{% endif %}" data-summary="{{ r.note or r.description or '' }}" data-keywords="{{ r.search_terms or '' }} {{ r.keywords or '' }} {{ r.commodity or '' }}" data-meta="{{ r.country or r.country_code or '' }} · {{ r.price_type or '' }}{% if r.observed_date %} · {{ r.observed_date }}{% endif %}" data-url="{{ r.source_url or r.url or '/markets/' }}"></article>
    {% endfor %}
    {% for r in agriculturalServices.records %}
      <article data-type="Service" data-title="{{ r.title }}" data-summary="{{ r.summary or '' }}" data-keywords="{{ r.search_terms or '' }} {{ r.keywords or '' }} {{ r.tags or '' }}" data-meta="{{ r.country or r.country_code or '' }} · {{ r.category or '' }} · {{ r.provider or '' }}" data-url="{{ r.url or '/agricultural-services/' }}"></article>
    {% endfor %}
    {% for item in collections.ebooks %}
      {% if item.data.active !== false and (item.data.translation_status or 'published') !== 'in_review' %}
        <article data-type="eBook" data-title="{{ item.data.title or item.data.name or '' }}" data-summary="{{ item.data.tagline or item.data.description or item.data.audience or '' }}" data-keywords="{{ item.data.search_terms or '' }} {{ item.data.keywords or '' }} {{ item.data.tags or '' }} {{ item.data.slug or item.fileSlug or '' }} {{ item.data.audience or '' }}" data-meta="{{ item.data.category or '' }} · eBook" data-url="{{ item.url }}"></article>
      {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
    {% for item in collections.posts %}
      {% if item.data.active !== false and (item.data.translation_status or 'published') !== 'in_review' %}
        <article data-type="Blog" data-title="{{ item.data.title or '' }}" data-summary="{{ item.data.description or item.data.excerpt or '' }}" data-keywords="{{ item.data.search_terms or '' }} {{ item.data.keywords or '' }} {{ item.data.tags or '' }} {{ item.data.slug or item.fileSlug or '' }}" data-meta="{{ item.data.category or '' }} · Blog · {{ item.data.language or 'en' }}" data-url="{{ item.url }}"></article>
      {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</div>

<script>
(function(){
  const input=document.getElementById('goa-global-search');
  const type=document.getElementById('goa-search-type');
  const results=document.getElementById('goa-search-results');
  const connections=document.getElementById('goa-search-connections');
  const connectionCards=document.getElementById('goa-connection-cards');
  const count=document.getElementById('goa-search-count');
  const topicAliases={maize:['maize','corn'],rice:['rice','paddy'],cassava:['cassava','manioc','yuca'],soybean:['soybean','soybeans','soya'],poultry:['poultry','chicken','broiler','layer'],livestock:['livestock','cattle','beef','dairy','milk','goat','sheep'],fish:['fish','fisheries','aquaculture','tilapia','catfish'],vegetables:['vegetable','vegetables','tomato','pepper','onion'],fruits:['fruit','fruits','banana','pineapple','avocado','mango'],seeds:['seed','seeds','certified seed','seed multiplication'],inputs:['fertilizer','fertiliser','inputs','agro-input','agrochemical'],irrigation:['irrigation','water management','water access','solar pumping'],mechanization:['mechanization','mechanisation','tractor','machinery','equipment'],finance:['finance','funding','grant','grants','loan','investment','credit','financing'],climate:['climate','resilience','drought','early warning','climate-smart'],markets:['market','markets','trade','export','value chain','agribusiness']};
  const tr=(key)=>window.GOA_I18N&&window.GOA_I18N.t?window.GOA_I18N.t("search",key):({resultSingular:"result",resultPlural:"results",showingFirst:"showing first 100",matching:"matching result",matchingPlural:"matching results",noResults:"No matching results found. Try a broader search or choose “All sections”."}[key]||key);
  const params=new URLSearchParams(location.search);
  if(params.get('q')) input.value=params.get('q');
  const source=[...document.querySelectorAll('#goa-search-source article')].map(el=>({
    type:el.dataset.type||'',
    title:el.dataset.title||'',
    summary:el.dataset.summary||'',
    keywords:el.dataset.keywords||'',
    meta:el.dataset.meta||'',
    url:el.dataset.url||''
  })).filter(x=>x.title&&x.url);
  function esc(s){return String(s).replace(/[&<>"]/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;'}[c]));}
  function localizedSectionUrl(section){
    const language=(window.GOA_I18N&&window.GOA_I18N.lang?window.GOA_I18N.lang():document.documentElement.lang||'en').split('-')[0];
    return language==='en'?'/'+section+'/':'/'+language+'/'+section+'/';
  }
  function render(){
    const q=input.value.trim().toLowerCase();
    const t=type.value;
    const words=q.split(/\s+/).filter(Boolean);
    const matches=source.filter(x=>{
      if(t&&x.type!==t)return false;
      const hay=(x.title+' '+x.summary+' '+x.keywords+' '+x.meta).toLowerCase();
      return !words.length||words.every(w=>{const variants=topicAliases[w]||[w];return variants.some(v=>hay.includes(v));});
    });
    const shown=matches.slice(0,100);
    const sections=[
      ['Market',tr('markets'),'/markets/','compareMarkets'],
      ['Opportunity',tr('opportunities'),'/opportunities/','financePrograms'],
      ['Resource',tr('resources'),localizedSectionUrl('agriculture-resources'),'supportingResources'],
      ['Service',tr('services'),'/agricultural-services/','servicesTraining'],
      ['News',tr('news'),localizedSectionUrl('agricultural-news'),'recentDevelopments'],
      ['eBook',tr('ebooks'),localizedSectionUrl('ebooks'),'practicalMethods'],
      ['Blog',tr('blog'),localizedSectionUrl('blog'),'detailedGuides']
    ];
    const matchedSections=sections.map(s=>({s,count:matches.filter(x=>x.type===s[0]).length})).filter(x=>x.count);
    if(q && matchedSections.length){
      connections.style.display='block';
      connectionCards.innerHTML=matchedSections.map(x=>'<a class="card" href="'+x.s[2]+'" style="text-decoration:none;padding:12px;"><strong>'+x.s[1]+'</strong><br><span style="font-size:.85rem;">'+x.count+' '+tr(x.count===1?'matching':'matchingPlural')+'</span></a>').join('');
    }else{
      connections.style.display='none';
      connectionCards.innerHTML='';
    }
    count.textContent=matches.length+' '+tr(matches.length===1?'resultSingular':'resultPlural')+(matches.length>100?' ('+tr('showingFirst')+')':'');
    if(!shown.length){
      results.innerHTML='<div class="goa-search-empty">'+esc(tr('noResults'))+'</div>';
      return;
    }
    results.innerHTML=shown.map(x=>'<article class="goa-search-card"><div class="goa-search-meta">'+esc(({Resource:tr('resources'),News:tr('news'),Opportunity:tr('opportunities'),Market:tr('markets'),Service:tr('services'),eBook:tr('ebooks'),Blog:tr('blog')})[x.type]||x.type)+' · '+esc(x.meta)+'</div><h2><a href="'+esc(x.url)+'">'+esc(x.title)+'</a></h2><p class="goa-search-summary">'+esc(x.summary).slice(0,320)+'</p></article>').join('');
  }
  input.addEventListener('input',render);
  type.addEventListener('change',render);
  document.addEventListener('goa:languagechange',render);
  render();
})();
</script>
